# N: drift NN in the loop (item b, 10-22). Same 30 s hover as lab_s_smoke, with g_drift_nn_live=1: the net's
# position correction is applied (velocity 0), clamped at g_drift_nn_clamp (VAR 57, default 0.10 m/s).
# Camera mode 0 or 1 only: the firmware CAMERA gate blocks the net while g_ext_pos_on >= 2. The embedded net
# predates the rawof leak fix, so this flight checks the live path is safe, not that the net is good.
# Fly it: fly lab_n_drift_nn_live --once (deck 2026-10-22-mode1). Pass (PROPOSED): no abort; drift_nn.live_on 1;
# camera minus estimate no worse than smoke-hover's shadow run (camera mode 1 logs it without applying it).
campaign lab-n-drift-nn-live
rate 100
log velocity_loops camera_fusion
slow 50 drift_nn nn4 xy_ctrl ekf_states estimator_truth takeoff_gate
set g_xy_ctrl_kind=0 g_traj_ff_shift_s=0 g_land_xy_gate_cm=10 g_drift_nn_live=1
takeoff 0.8
hold 30
land
